  "answer": "Since your checked bag weighs 30 kg and you're on a Classic fare, you will be charged an overweight fee of EUR 50 per bag per flight. This is because the weight limit for a standard checked bag on a Classic fare is 27 kg. The overweight fee applies to bags between 27 kg and 32 kg. Bags over 32 kg are not accepted as checked baggage and must be sent as cargo. Therefore, your total fee is EUR 50.",
